<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Other">Other</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Mechanics?veaction=edit&amp;section=22" title="Edit section: Other" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Mechanics?action=edit&amp;section=22" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Other"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Ascensions">Ascensions</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Mechanics?veaction=edit&amp;section=23" title="Edit section: Ascensions" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Mechanics?action=edit&amp;section=23" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Ascensions"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<blockquote><p><i>Runs get harder as you win... (Winstreaks are unaffected).</i> </p></blockquote><p>See a list of Ascension modifiers <a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">here</a>.</p>
